title: "Campi Flegrei Quantitative Monitoring System"
abstract: "An integrated seismic monitoring system for the Campi Flegrei caldera combining Gutenberg-Richter b-value estimation, anomaly detection, multi-signal fusion, Early Warning System, ETAS stochastic modeling, and Hybrid Deep Learning architectures (LSTM, Autoencoders)."
